---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="container grid">
    <div class="about">
      <a href="/" class="brand" aria-label="TambuTech - Home">
        <img src="/logo-symbol.svg" alt="" width="40" height="46" loading="lazy" />
        <span class="word"><b>Tambu</b><span>Tech</span></span>
      </a>
      <p class="muted">
        Sviluppo app, progetti DIY, stampa 3D, elettronica e Arduino. Dall'idea al progetto finito.
      </p>
      <a
        class="social"
        href="https://www.instagram.com/tambu.tech/"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        aria-label="TambuTech su Instagram (si apre in una nuova scheda)"
      >
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
          <rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="5" />
          <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4" />
          <circle cx="17.5" cy="6.5" r="0.6" fill="currentColor" />
        </svg>
        <span>@tambu.tech</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <nav aria-label="Link del sito">
      <h2>Il sito</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
        <li><a href="/preventivo/">Preventivo</a></li>
        <li><a href="/progetti-realizzati/">Progetti realizzati</a></li>
        <li><a href="/progetti-in-corso/">Progetti in corso</a></li>
        <li><a href="/chi-sono/">Chi sono</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>

    <div>
      <h2>Hai un'idea?</h2>
      <p class="muted">Raccontamela e ti preparo un preventivo gratuito e senza impegno.</p>
      <a href="/preventivo/" class="btn btn-sm">Richiedi preventivo</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="container legal">
    <small>© {year} TambuTech · Federico Tamburrino · Porlezza (CO)</small>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .site-footer {
    position: relative;
    margin-top: 3rem;
    background: var(--bg-elevated);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding-top: 3rem;
  }
  /* filo decorativo azzurro → cremisi sul bordo */
  .site-footer::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: -1px;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    height: 2px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--blue-line), var(--accent), transparent);
  }
  .grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 2.25rem;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }
  @media (min-width: 720px) {
    .grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr 1.2fr;
    }
  }
  .brand {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    min-height: 48px;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .brand img {
    width: auto;
    height: 44px;
  }
  .word {
    font-family: var(--font-logo);
    font-size: 1.45rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .word b {
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--blue);
  }
  .word span {
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--crimson-text);
  }
  .social {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    min-height: 44px;
    padding: 0 1rem 0 0.8rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    font-weight: 500;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition:
      border-color 0.15s,
      color 0.15s;
  }
  .social svg {
    color: var(--accent-text);
  }
  .social:hover {
    border-color: var(--blue-line);
    color: #fff;
  }
  h2 {
    margin-bottom: 0.9rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--blue);
  }
  ul {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }
  li a {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 44px;
    color: var(--text);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  li a:hover {
    color: var(--accent-text);
  }
  .legal {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    padding-top: 1.25rem;
    padding-bottom: max(1.25rem, env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
</style>
